p medians and proportions, respectively; p-values <0.05 were considered statistically significant.\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"VE was calculated as [1 − odds ratio] x 100, estimated using conditional logistic regression in a test-negative design\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"In a sensitivity analysis, VE was also estimated defining previous infection as a positive NAAT result.\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}